{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1316329-your-funny-headcanons","id":1316329,"title":"Your Funny Headcanons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-06-03T16:44:06-07:00","id":1316329,"title":"Your Funny Headcanons","content":"Like it says. What are the more humorous interpretations of the lore you've come up with?<br /> <br /> Mine is that the Scarlet Empress accidentally built a cult that thinks she didn't name important things to transcend mortality. In reality, she was just terrible at thinking up names; she called herself that because red's a favorite color, the only name she could think of for her realm was &quot;the Realm&quot;, she named the Realm Defense Grid that because that's what it does, &quot;Mnemon&quot; and &quot;Ragara&quot; are the Shogunate equivalents of &quot;Katie&quot; and &quot;John&quot;, and the Imperial City has no name because by the time it grew up, she decided to roll with it instead of calling it what she originally wanted, &quot;Throneplace.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-04T00:02:13-07:00","id":1316386,"title":"","content":"Queen Merela isn't dead, only legally dead, well retired. She agreed to live in her grand tomb city if the Usurpation would leave her alone. They agreed because it saved them the trouble of killing the living Hero of the Primordial War and then appeasing her hungry ghosts with staggering treasure.<br /> <br /> Octavian used to crash parties of the First Age, and he used to also chariot race, and play various sporting events with a lot of the renowned Exalts and Horrors of the First Age. But he mostly was interested in smashing folks in bloodsports.<br /> <br /> Hell is one of the last places in Existence outside of Heaven where Ice Cream is a famous food, as after the fall of the 1st Age only select Sorcerer and Scavenger Kings have reinvented/discovered the recipes for things like sherbert, soft serve, or cold stone ice cream.<br /> <br /> The Town of Fortitude from Chuubo's Marvelous Wish Granting Engine exists somewhere in the Wyld.<br /> <br /> Hell Crack uses Hell Porcelain, and Hell Meth uses Hell Glass.<br /> <br /> The Empress may have been overweight as a small child but overcoming that shaped her into who she is.<br /> <br /> At some point in the First Age Pogs were a thing, but they probably didn't even last a decade.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-04T01:14:39-07:00","id":1316394,"title":"","content":"There is a god somewhere in Yu-shan who's job it is to store and maintain strong and ancient brands and bottles of alcoholic beverages. These bottles are put on store by Sidereals as they get older with instructions for how long into their next incarnation's time working the duty they are to be given said bottle because the Sid believes about then said future incarnation will need that stiff a drink.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-04T09:50:10-07:00","id":1316445,"title":"","content":"If he\u2019s threatened by someone else\u2019s agents, Mnemon will use her resources to save Ragara\u2019s life if she can - BECAUSE HE IS NOT ALLOWED TO DIE UNTIL HE SEES HER ON THE THRONE!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-04T10:53:45-07:00","id":1316455,"title":"","content":"All the first ed, second ed and third ed fluff is canon. The seeming contractions are primarily the result of young Sidreals and Solars making really good rolls to introduce facts","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{