},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-05T05:10:58-07:00","id":1316604,"title":"","content":"Plus, Celestial Wine is made from the Peaches of Immortality, right? You don't need to enlighten their essence for that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4086-croakamancer","name":"Croakamancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4086_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-06T11:56:45-07:00","id":1316868,"title":"","content":"I like to imagine that the Games of Divinity are like Dejarik (The holographic game they play on the Millennium Falcon in Star Wars) just with a bigger board. Each of the Incarnae has controls and the other gods get to sit and watch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5172-navar","name":"Navar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-07T05:48:07-07:00","id":1316968,"title":"","content":"I have a mentor NPC in our current game. He is soon to be revealed to be old enough to have access to 2nd Edition Charms.<br /> <br /> I also have a PC in our current game. She has a set of Artifact pinions, given to her by a Lunar whose spirit shape is a rust-colored bull. She hasn't caught the joke that the red bull gave her wings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http